# Ameen Retail UI tokens

Visual source of truth: `docs/architecture/08-ui-design-tokens.md` and `docs/architecture/tokens.css`.

- Seed / primary: `#147D78`. Use CSS variables (`--color-primary`, …), not ad-hoc hex.
- Fonts: Inter for headline, body, and label. No second display font.
- Default corner radius: 12px (`--radius-md`). Pills only for avatars, switches, badges.
- Light theme is the product default. Dark tokens exist; do not restyle POS as dark-only.
- Tabular numerals for money and quantities.
- Do not copy colors or radii from the old ERP.
